### Run the API first:  cd PizzaApi && dotnet run --urls http://localhost:5100
### (VS Code: install the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request")

### GET all pizzas  -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:5100/pizza

### POST a new pizza -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:5100/pizza
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hawaiian", "isGlutenFree": false }

### PUT update pizza 2 -> 204 No Content
PUT http://localhost:5100/pizza/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 2, "name": "Veggie Deluxe", "isGlutenFree": true }

### DELETE pizza 1 -> 204 No Content
DELETE http://localhost:5100/pizza/1

### GET all again to check the changes
GET http://localhost:5100/pizza
